{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15243060","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15243060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1524306001:0":{"text":"어서! 벌레가 그쪽으로 갔어!","source_cn":"快，快！虫子跑到你那边了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645CA4EB47B2301F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1524306002:1":{"text":"너무 빨라서 보이지도 않아!","source_cn":"它们跑得太快了，我看不清啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3A6926E871D2E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524306003:0":{"text":"그 몬스터는 어디 있지? 비켜라. 내가 처치할 테니!","source_cn":"那些怪物在哪里？让开，我来对付它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF6B32220FBAA57B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524306004:0":{"text":"뭐? 뭐라고? 몬스터? 몬스터가 나왔다고?","source_cn":"啊？什、什么怪物，有怪物跑过来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27237B4977D579D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1524306005:0":{"text":"...가시 메뚜기가 나타난 게 아니었나?","source_cn":"……不是说有针蝗怪物导致的虫灾吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802A00BD8F1B4A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1524306006:1":{"tex